  speakerName: WORKER 2
  line: She owed the house more than any of us earns in a year. He was the only thing
    standing between her and collection. Protected account. His personal authorisation.
    The moment he's gone, that protection goes with him." (beat) "She had more reason
    to want him dead than anyone in this building. And less reason than anyone to
    say so.
